   one LakebaseBase hook (`live_table`); the frozen LakebaseFlatStore is unchanged.
3. src/jobs/triple_stream/main.py (new), SparkColumnText.py (new) (c4da31ce, fd16458a)
   TripleStreamJob: validated arguments; readStream options for kafka / Event Hubs
